.modal-header
  %h3
    Are you
    %strong ABSOLUTELY
    sure?
.modal-body
  %p
    Make sure to terminate the boxes you no longer need, before canceling subscription.
  %p
    You won't be able to cancel the subscription, if you have additional unterminated boxes.

.modal-footer
  %button.btn(_action='didClickCancel target="view"')
    No, Take me back
  %button.btn.btn-danger(_action='didClickProceed target="view"'){ bind: { disabled: 'cancelingSubscription' } }
    Yes, Cancel subscription
